      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. so i have a specific question from a client. they have a high-performing director who's up for a VP role, but her team thinks she's a bit \"unpolished\" for the boardroom. she has very natural, voluminous curly hair and she sometimes wears a headscarf for religious reasons. how should she handle her hair and headwear to make sure she doesn't look \"distracting\" and fits that \"clean and sharp\" image you mentioned? like, what are the best ways to minimize her",
